font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 개설된 강좌에 여석이 있을 경우 전산으로만 수강신청 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-<strong> </strong></span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년별 수강신청 확인 및 변경 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(9. 4.~ 6.)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 신청한 과목 삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">변경 및 신규추가 신청 가능</span></strong></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 교과목코드 직접 입력하여 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일부 강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고급한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제마케팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(BD0033-02), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기술경영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(BD0037-02)]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 개시 후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -107.2pt; margin-left: 107.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학교홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로그인 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) - </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설과목안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -107.2pt; margin-left: 107.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 원스톱서비스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학부 개설과목 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“2019</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">” </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참조</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강과목 변경신청서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부터 학과사무실로 제출바람</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청기간 동안 본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호 관리를 철저히 하여 수강신청 시 불미한 경우가 없도록 주의하시기 바라며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">악의적인 의도로 타인의 아이디를 사용하여 신청 또는 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">삭제를 하는 경우 엄중히 처벌할 예정임</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청사이트 메뉴안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강과목 변경신청서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
